#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:5
#: e8365b2a99c54c5ab1fa8c2c3e77f5d7
msgid "Tuning Pivot Turns"
msgstr "原地转向调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:10
#: 9a961e82a2884e1981f720dbd93ad6bb
msgid ""
"This page describes how to tune the \"pivot turn\" feature on a Rover (or "
"boat) with :ref:`skid-steering <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何在具有 :ref:`差速转向 <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>` 的 "
"Rover（或船）上调节「原地转向」功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:12
#: e022612d13524b1795fdb93aac19837c
msgid ""
"A pivot turn involves the vehicle slowing or stopping, turning towards the "
"destination and then continuing.  When enabled,these turns are only "
"triggered in :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`, :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>`, :ref:`RTL"
" <rtl-mode>` or :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` modes and only as a vehicle "
"first starts towards the next waypoint."
msgstr ""
"原地转向是指车辆减速或停止，转向目标方向后再继续行驶。启用后，此类转向仅在 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`、:ref:`Guided "
"<guided-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 或 :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` "
"模式下触发，且仅在车辆刚开始驶向下一航点时触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:14
#: 0e3fb78b1bef4e6882f21abb9729496c
msgid ""
"By default, smooth \"S-Curves\" are used all the autonomous modes including "
":ref:`Auto<auto-mode>`, :ref:`Guided<guided-mode>`, :ref:`RTL<rtl-mode>` and"
" :ref:`SmartRTL<smartrtl-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，包括 :ref:`Auto<auto-mode>`、:ref:`Guided<guided-mode>`、:ref:`RTL<rtl-"
"mode>` 和 :ref:`SmartRTL<smartrtl-mode>` 在内的所有自主模式均使用平滑的「S 曲线」。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:17
#: 56d347dd0169419bba814a0f4502ad15
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:19
#: e51d1205b45d406d8e3aa2dfb98f425a
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_PIVOT_ANGLE <WP_PIVOT_ANGLE>` holds the minimum angle error that "
"will trigger a pivot turn.  By default, this value is \"0\" which disables "
"Pivot Turn behavior and enables \"S-Curves\". For example when set to "
"\"60\", a pivot turn will be triggered if the vehicle's heading is at least "
"60 degrees off from the next waypoint.  This parameter should normally not "
"be set below 30 unless you wish to disable pivot-turns which can be done by "
"setting this parameter to 0.  The vehicle will begin towards the next "
"waypoints once its heading is within 10 degrees of the heading to the "
"destination"
msgstr ""
":ref:`WP_PIVOT_ANGLE <WP_PIVOT_ANGLE>` "
"保存触发原地转向的最小角度误差。该参数默认为「0」，即禁用原地转向行为并启用「S 曲线」。例如设为「60」时，若车辆航向与下一航点方向的偏差至少为 60"
" 度，则会触发原地转向。该参数通常不应设置为低于 30，除非希望禁用原地转向（将该参数设为 0 即可）。当车辆航向与目标方向的偏差在 10 "
"度以内时，车辆将开始驶向下一航点"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:20
#: f2d6929cdcdb484792c9493df327adc1
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_PIVOT_RATE <WP_PIVOT_RATE>` holds the maximum turn rate of the "
"vehicle (in degrees per second) during a pivot turn"
msgstr ":ref:`WP_PIVOT_RATE <WP_PIVOT_RATE>` 设定车辆在原地转向期间的最大转向速率（单位：度/秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:21
#: c92793b21c9740488e41597d1d92c11a
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ANG_P <ATC_STR_ANG_P>` converts the vehicle's heading error "
"into a desired turn rate.  Higher values lead to a more aggressive turn "
"towards the destination."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ANG_P <ATC_STR_ANG_P>` 将车辆航向误差转换为目标转向速率。较高的值将使车辆更积极地转向目标方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:22
#: e9daf95a770a45e3bb60ca6371f5f1f9
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` limits the vehicle's maximum turn "
"rate (in degrees per second) in all modes including during pivot turns."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` 限制车辆在所有模式（包括原地转向）中的最大转向速率（单位：度/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:23
#: ee185f30545f4c108b72a425f19fb7e6
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ACC_MAX <ATC_STR_ACC_MAX>` limits the vehicle's maximum "
"rotational acceleration (in deg/sec/sec) in all modes.  higher numbers lead "
"to the vehicle getting up to its maximum turn rate more quickly"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_ACC_MAX <ATC_STR_ACC_MAX>` "
"限制车辆在所有模式中的最大旋转加速度（单位：度/秒/秒）。较高的值使车辆更快达到最大转向速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-pivot-turns.rst:24
#: 015d87d5adc34cf2ac26ef443a15dd03
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_DEC_MAX<ATC_STR_DEC_MAX>` sets the steering control angular "
"deceleration maximum (in deg/s/s) that the autopilot will use when "
"approaching a pivot turn to lessen overshoots. If set to 0, the "
":ref:`ATC_STR_ACC_MAX<ATC_STR_ACC_MAX>` value will be used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_DEC_MAX<ATC_STR_DEC_MAX>` 设置转向控制的最大角减速度（单位 "
"deg/s/s），飞控在接近原地转向时会使用该值以减少超调。若设为 0，则使用 "
":ref:`ATC_STR_ACC_MAX<ATC_STR_ACC_MAX>` 的值。"

